WEBVTT

00:31.527 --> 00:35.077
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.097 --> 00:38.477
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.747 --> 00:44.717
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.877 --> 00:49.507
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.527 --> 00:53.037
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.057 --> 00:56.547
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.567 --> 01:00.077
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.097 --> 01:06.157
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.417 --> 01:23.697
Si Jin

01:23.717 --> 01:27.697
Episode 14

01:27.697 --> 01:30.217
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

01:56.757 --> 01:58.117
Mother...

02:01.197 --> 02:02.707
Mother,

02:03.197 --> 02:05.797
I've been lying on my stomach for days.

02:06.267 --> 02:07.957
I could really use a walk.

02:09.037 --> 02:10.797
Without my permission,

02:11.147 --> 02:13.547
you can't leave the Mingyue Chamber.

02:13.597 --> 02:14.917
Resting like this all day

02:14.917 --> 02:17.337
doesn't help me recover.

02:17.357 --> 02:19.577
I've got the word out.

02:19.597 --> 02:21.207
You're in a critical condition.

02:21.227 --> 02:23.707
You've been having a fever and unconscious.

02:25.827 --> 02:27.197
Why?

02:28.547 --> 02:29.907
Why?

02:31.477 --> 02:32.967
Do you know the victims include

02:32.987 --> 02:35.407
Yang Shengcai, your cousin,

02:35.427 --> 02:38.077
and the Censor-in-chief's son?

02:38.107 --> 02:40.127
A censor is nothing.

02:40.147 --> 02:41.687
I'm not afraid.

02:41.707 --> 02:44.387
Zhang Sheng was merely

02:44.387 --> 02:46.827
an alienated son of a concubine.

02:47.667 --> 02:50.297
That censor is on Prince Qi's side.

02:50.317 --> 02:51.667
Seizing this chance,

02:51.667 --> 02:53.857
he's brought your uncle's attention
to this case.

02:53.877 --> 02:54.877
Your uncle

02:54.877 --> 02:56.587
wouldn't leave it unsolved.

02:58.147 --> 03:00.387
He ordered Capital Security

03:00.387 --> 03:02.027
to investigate it.

03:02.317 --> 03:03.797
Before this case ends,

03:04.107 --> 03:05.337
do not take one step

03:05.357 --> 03:07.707
out of this chamber.

03:09.597 --> 03:11.147
Fine, Mother.

03:12.797 --> 03:14.547
Do you really not know

03:15.077 --> 03:17.587
how the fire started?

03:21.267 --> 03:22.627
I...

03:23.077 --> 03:25.547
I was too drunk that day

03:26.517 --> 03:28.147
to remember.

03:32.037 --> 03:34.587
Since Prince Qi won't let it go,

03:35.387 --> 03:38.587
I'll give him what he wants.

03:38.827 --> 03:40.057
What are you doing?

03:40.077 --> 03:41.337
Let go of my son!

03:41.357 --> 03:42.527
Mother!

03:42.547 --> 03:44.617
- Let him go!
- What's going on?

03:44.637 --> 03:45.947
Let go of my son...

03:45.947 --> 03:47.177
Hands off!

03:47.197 --> 03:48.827
I'm begging you, sir!

03:48.827 --> 03:51.517
Please let go of Chongyi, sir!

03:51.547 --> 03:52.617
Ma'am,

03:52.637 --> 03:54.317
Grand Princess sent us to bring him over

03:54.317 --> 03:56.247
to treat his leg.

03:56.267 --> 03:57.967
Please step aside.

03:57.987 --> 03:59.497
Or would you rather annoy her

03:59.517 --> 04:01.637
(Shijiu, Grand Princess's Guard)
and the Crown Prince?

04:01.637 --> 04:02.517
Don't threaten us

04:02.517 --> 04:04.197
just because we're women.

04:04.317 --> 04:05.467
This is Ling'an.

04:05.487 --> 04:06.557
You're in a duke's mansion.

04:06.557 --> 04:08.537
You can't barge in and take him away.

04:08.557 --> 04:11.127
We appreciate Her Highness's kindness.

04:11.147 --> 04:12.117
Honey...

04:12.137 --> 04:13.587
Help our son, honey!

04:13.587 --> 04:14.947
Father...

04:15.557 --> 04:18.187
It's my son's honor to be treated

04:18.347 --> 04:20.277
in Her Highness's mansion.

04:20.587 --> 04:23.507
What do you mean, Father?

04:25.637 --> 04:26.827
Sir... Chongyi...!

04:26.827 --> 04:27.907
Father, Father!

04:27.907 --> 04:29.277
Chongyi!

04:29.437 --> 04:30.987
- Chongyi!
- Let me go!

04:31.387 --> 04:32.497
Chongyi!

04:32.517 --> 04:33.877
Chongyi!

04:33.907 --> 04:35.557
Honey, help!

04:35.557 --> 04:36.517
Do something.

04:36.517 --> 04:38.317
They can't take away your son like this!

04:38.317 --> 04:39.587
You're a duke after all.

04:39.587 --> 04:41.617
Or is that only an empty title?

04:41.637 --> 04:43.927
Yes, it is!

04:43.947 --> 04:45.367
Are you happy now?

04:45.387 --> 04:47.857
The Grand Princess dominates the court,

04:47.877 --> 04:49.827
and she's backed by the Crown Prince.

04:49.947 --> 04:52.007
I'm a mere figurehead as a duke.

04:52.027 --> 04:53.947
Would I dare provoke her?

04:54.197 --> 04:56.507
What are they going to do to my son?

04:56.557 --> 04:58.157
Tell me!

04:58.197 --> 04:59.917
This is his fate.

05:00.907 --> 05:04.627
That black sheep brought it on himself.

05:07.707 --> 05:09.327
At this point,

05:09.347 --> 05:10.657
he's on his own.

05:10.677 --> 05:12.677
Risking our clan

05:16.197 --> 05:19.797
and my unborn grandchild

05:20.147 --> 05:21.667
for him isn't worth it.

05:23.247 --> 05:24.607
You...

05:25.557 --> 05:28.307
My poor son, Chongyi!

05:29.347 --> 05:30.717
Ma'am.

05:35.387 --> 05:37.237
Grand Princess has arrived!

05:58.677 --> 06:01.797
Are you Duke An's third son?

06:02.827 --> 06:04.947
Yes, Your Highness.

06:06.587 --> 06:08.007
Your leg was burned.

06:08.027 --> 06:09.547
No need to kneel.

06:10.027 --> 06:11.387
Rise.

06:11.757 --> 06:13.117
Yes.

06:13.757 --> 06:15.637
Do you know why I had you

06:15.637 --> 06:17.187
brought here?

06:20.117 --> 06:21.947
Thanks for your kindness,

06:22.637 --> 06:26.277
but my family is worried about me.

06:26.467 --> 06:28.987
I should go back soon.

06:30.197 --> 06:31.917
That place was burned.

06:32.387 --> 06:34.917
Only you and Mingyue survived.

06:35.267 --> 06:36.927
The three families of the victims

06:36.947 --> 06:39.117
must be in grief.

06:40.147 --> 06:42.367
The Cui Clan is our family.

06:42.387 --> 06:44.867
The Yangs aren't a problem.

06:45.267 --> 06:46.947
But the Zhangs

06:47.317 --> 06:49.597
refuse to let it go.

06:49.677 --> 06:51.757
They insist on blaming Mingyue

06:51.757 --> 06:54.117
for Zhang Sheng's death.

06:54.387 --> 06:57.237
Instead of going after

06:57.237 --> 06:59.277
Duke An's Mansion,

06:59.877 --> 07:02.307
why are they holding us accountable?

07:02.877 --> 07:04.237
Your Highness,

07:05.347 --> 07:06.737
you have to trust me!

07:06.757 --> 07:09.917
All of us were drunk that night.

07:10.317 --> 07:11.947
The... the wind must've

07:11.947 --> 07:13.877
tipped over the candlestick,

07:13.877 --> 07:15.507
causing the fire.

07:15.787 --> 07:17.357
Princess Mingyue and I

07:17.907 --> 07:19.507
are the victims!

07:19.707 --> 07:22.177
That fire was a pure accident.

07:22.197 --> 07:25.007
An unfortunate accident!

07:25.027 --> 07:27.127
The Zhangs didn't believe

07:27.147 --> 07:29.067
it was an accident.

07:29.267 --> 07:31.547
One of you must've

07:31.677 --> 07:33.237
overturned it

07:33.237 --> 07:34.837
by accident

07:35.517 --> 07:38.837
or set the room on fire, drunk.

07:40.147 --> 07:43.237
But Mingyue didn't do it.

07:44.267 --> 07:45.917
You're wise.

07:46.387 --> 07:47.877
You know that, don't you?

07:48.237 --> 07:50.277
Yes, I understand.

07:50.517 --> 07:52.327
Princess Mingyue didn't do it.

07:52.347 --> 07:53.867
It wasn't her.

07:57.877 --> 07:59.007
It...

07:59.027 --> 08:01.007
It wasn't me either.

08:01.027 --> 08:03.037
Not me, Your Highness!

08:03.637 --> 08:04.997
It...

08:05.997 --> 08:07.517
It was Jiang Zhan! Jiang Zhan!

08:07.517 --> 08:09.357
From Earl Dongping's Mansion!

08:09.707 --> 08:11.307
Jiang Zhan?

08:13.557 --> 08:15.477
Earl Dongping's Mansion?

08:17.707 --> 08:20.357
Shijiu, go and check.

08:20.467 --> 08:22.077
Yes, Your Highness.

08:34.907 --> 08:36.437
Poor Zhan.

08:36.637 --> 08:39.717
He hadn't married before death.

08:40.307 --> 08:42.597
Let him rest in peace.

08:43.307 --> 08:45.787
The rest of us have to move on.

08:46.147 --> 08:47.507
Mother,

08:47.637 --> 08:50.197
should we start

08:50.237 --> 08:52.787
setting up his funeral?

08:54.427 --> 08:55.977
We haven't found him.

08:55.997 --> 08:58.497
He might still be alive.

08:58.517 --> 09:01.097
You can't wait to hold the funeral.

09:01.117 --> 09:02.697
What are you up to?

09:02.717 --> 09:05.007
I'm devastated by his death, too.

09:05.027 --> 09:06.837
You and your brother were close.

09:06.837 --> 09:08.337
It's hard for you to process it.

09:08.357 --> 09:12.077
But we've been looking for him for a week.

09:12.237 --> 09:15.367
It's almost impossible for him to survive.

09:15.387 --> 09:16.867
As the saying goes,

09:17.187 --> 09:18.947
burial brings peace to the dead.

09:19.237 --> 09:20.597
Only in that way

09:20.637 --> 09:22.127
can the bereaved like us

09:22.147 --> 09:24.267
honor him properly.

09:24.597 --> 09:26.237
However long it takes,

09:26.307 --> 09:28.987
I won't stop until my son's found.

09:31.547 --> 09:34.267
Poor Zhan!

09:34.717 --> 09:36.737
We can't let his soul

09:36.757 --> 09:38.557
keep drifting.

09:38.667 --> 09:42.047
Hold the funeral soon.

09:42.067 --> 09:43.617
Yes, Mother.

09:43.637 --> 09:46.147
Capital Security and our people

09:46.147 --> 09:48.147
have been searching for days.

09:48.837 --> 09:50.027
Only a shoe has been salvaged.

09:50.027 --> 09:52.027
There's little money left.

09:52.907 --> 09:55.507
I'm afraid it's unlikely to find him.

09:57.147 --> 09:58.507
Mother,

09:58.547 --> 10:00.287
you know,

10:00.307 --> 10:03.237
we've spent a fortune

10:03.267 --> 10:05.117
on the search,

10:05.237 --> 10:07.127
and used up almost all our savings.

10:07.147 --> 10:09.557
To continue it,

10:09.667 --> 10:10.577
you'll

10:10.597 --> 10:12.907
have to give us more money.

10:13.787 --> 10:15.437
We have to bring him

10:16.267 --> 10:18.027
or his body back.

10:18.187 --> 10:19.857
Find him at all costs.

10:19.877 --> 10:21.437
I'll raise

10:21.637 --> 10:23.167
more money myself.

10:23.187 --> 10:25.597
Don't worry about it, Anmou and Xiao.

10:25.717 --> 10:27.937
Si, say no more.

10:27.957 --> 10:29.667
Let's go on looking for him.

10:29.957 --> 10:31.907
She's so spoiled by you

10:32.597 --> 10:33.977
that she acts

10:33.997 --> 10:35.767
without scruple.

10:35.787 --> 10:38.737
Your brother died because of you!

10:38.757 --> 10:40.117
Grandmother,

10:40.787 --> 10:42.097
what are you talking about?

10:42.117 --> 10:44.667
You killed Zhan!

10:44.757 --> 10:47.717
Ancheng, we had talked about it.

10:47.837 --> 10:49.717
I only hoped

10:50.117 --> 10:52.837
Zhan would stop causing us trouble

10:52.997 --> 10:55.817
and lead a peaceful life

10:55.837 --> 10:58.907
as an earl's son.

11:00.117 --> 11:01.477
But what did you do?

11:01.637 --> 11:03.907
You forced him to learn martial arts.

11:03.907 --> 11:05.547
He practiced so hard

11:05.547 --> 11:06.957
that he didn't have time

11:06.957 --> 11:08.317
to eat at the table!

11:09.067 --> 11:13.747
He used to go out in the morning

11:14.667 --> 11:16.647
and come back at dusk.

11:16.667 --> 11:18.697
Then he'd come to see me.

11:18.717 --> 11:20.117
But this time,

11:20.757 --> 11:23.007
he sneaked out at night.

11:23.027 --> 11:24.787
He didn't want to come home

11:24.787 --> 11:27.517
all because of you!

11:27.517 --> 11:30.237
You killed him!

11:33.787 --> 11:35.127
It was my fault.

11:35.147 --> 11:36.237
It was all my fault!

11:36.237 --> 11:37.877
So whatever it takes,

11:37.877 --> 11:39.887
I'll find him!

11:39.907 --> 11:42.987
- Si...
- Bad news! Bad news!

11:43.427 --> 11:44.617
Bad news, My Lady!

11:44.637 --> 11:46.007
A group of soldiers have

11:46.027 --> 11:47.987
had our mansion surrounded.

11:48.617 --> 11:49.467
Let's go!

11:49.467 --> 11:51.377
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

11:53.067 --> 11:54.247
Who are you?

11:54.267 --> 11:55.877
Chief Iron Guard, Shijiu,

11:55.877 --> 11:57.497
of Grand Princess Rongyang.

11:57.517 --> 11:58.767
Her Highness

11:58.787 --> 12:00.387
sent us to seal Earl Dongping's Mansion.

12:00.387 --> 12:01.617
No one goes in or out.

12:01.637 --> 12:02.857
Why did she

12:02.877 --> 12:04.597
give such an order?

12:04.597 --> 12:05.797
Jiang Zhan is the prime suspect

12:05.797 --> 12:06.997
in the Huiyue House Arson Case.

12:06.997 --> 12:08.647
Her Highness sent us to guard

12:08.667 --> 12:10.547
your mansion in case he escapes.

12:10.547 --> 12:11.617
Ridiculous!

12:11.637 --> 12:13.247
My brother is the victim.

12:13.267 --> 12:15.097
How could you treat him as a criminal?

12:15.117 --> 12:16.217
Once we find him,

12:16.237 --> 12:17.697
we'll prove you're wrong.

12:17.717 --> 12:20.367
This is for the reputation of your mansion.

12:20.387 --> 12:21.697
Don't do anything stupid,

12:21.717 --> 12:23.987
or we will resort to force.

12:24.477 --> 12:25.837
I dare you!

12:28.997 --> 12:30.957
Thanks for Her Highness's kindness.

12:32.597 --> 12:33.987
Hold Lady Jiang back.

12:34.757 --> 12:35.817
Let's go, Mother.

12:35.837 --> 12:37.597
Her Highness's nephew died.

12:37.617 --> 12:38.987
Her only daughter is having a fever

12:38.987 --> 12:40.007
and still unconscious.

12:40.027 --> 12:42.317
This case concerns her family.

12:42.357 --> 12:43.357
That's why she sent us

12:43.357 --> 12:44.497
to help.

12:44.517 --> 12:46.647
An open trial will begin tomorrow.

12:46.667 --> 12:48.647
Her Highness can leave it to us.

12:48.667 --> 12:50.007
As for Jiang Zhan,

12:50.027 --> 12:51.337
my men will keep an eye out.

12:51.357 --> 12:52.697
Nothing will go wrong.

12:52.717 --> 12:54.627
Here's a friendly reminder.

12:54.667 --> 12:56.337
Don't overreach yourself

12:56.357 --> 12:57.717
for your own sake.

12:57.907 --> 13:00.737
I expect you to be fair and just, Mr. Yu.

13:00.757 --> 13:01.857
Of course.

13:01.877 --> 13:03.237
Let's go!

13:04.237 --> 13:05.867
Thanks for helping us out.

13:06.117 --> 13:07.987
Luckily, I got the news in time.

13:08.517 --> 13:09.877
I'm glad you're fine.

13:10.477 --> 13:12.047
I failed to help Zhan out,

13:12.067 --> 13:13.857
and I kept putting you in danger.

13:13.877 --> 13:15.267
I'm really sorry.

13:15.877 --> 13:16.977
No worries.

13:16.997 --> 13:19.077
It wasn't your fault.

13:19.357 --> 13:20.987
I have a question.

13:21.387 --> 13:24.077
What you told me about Jiang Zhan

13:24.387 --> 13:26.107
is more than a dream, isn't it?

13:29.957 --> 13:31.317
Sorry.

13:32.187 --> 13:33.937
I shouldn't have brought that up

13:33.957 --> 13:35.557
and upset you.

13:36.547 --> 13:38.237
I don't have time to be upset.

13:38.637 --> 13:40.627
Zhan is still missing.

13:40.957 --> 13:42.337
The Grand Princess

13:42.357 --> 13:44.047
is going to make him

13:44.067 --> 13:45.727
the scapegoat for everything.

13:46.267 --> 13:48.557
- But that night...
- Stick to what I said.

13:49.267 --> 13:50.987
You didn't go there that night.

13:57.597 --> 13:59.577
How could I let them

13:59.597 --> 14:00.717
throw dirt on my brother

14:00.717 --> 14:02.457
just to protect myself?

14:02.477 --> 14:04.387
I believe he also wouldn't want you

14:04.387 --> 14:06.747
to take risks for him.

14:08.597 --> 14:10.357
Let's figure something else out.

14:18.027 --> 14:19.387
Mother,

14:19.717 --> 14:21.627
you said you meant to

14:21.717 --> 14:23.667
marry Si

14:23.717 --> 14:25.357
into the Zhen Mansion, right?

14:27.237 --> 14:29.907
That was only a verbal agreement.

14:30.027 --> 14:33.317
The Zhen Clan hasn't proposed.

14:33.427 --> 14:35.117
You saw

14:35.267 --> 14:38.747
how intimidating the Grand Princess was.

14:39.957 --> 14:41.127
Now,

14:41.147 --> 14:43.647
there's not much I can do.

14:43.667 --> 14:46.887
I'll marry Si into the family

14:46.907 --> 14:50.477
that can protect our clan.

14:51.957 --> 14:54.077
That's so thoughtful of you, Mother.

14:55.387 --> 14:58.237
But in that case,

14:58.717 --> 14:59.717
will others judge us,

14:59.717 --> 15:01.867
saying we promise Si

15:01.957 --> 15:04.027
to two families?

15:04.117 --> 15:07.527
We aren't sure if Zhan is still alive.

15:07.547 --> 15:11.437
I don't care what others say.

15:15.067 --> 15:16.427
I had you

15:16.667 --> 15:18.957
stay in your courtyard

15:19.027 --> 15:20.907
because you were sick.

15:21.907 --> 15:23.577
I wanted you

15:23.597 --> 15:25.987
to get enough rest.

15:26.237 --> 15:28.457
Now that

15:28.477 --> 15:30.837
you've become much better,

15:30.997 --> 15:33.047
and Si is still too young

15:33.067 --> 15:35.097
after all,

15:35.117 --> 15:36.337
I've had them

15:36.357 --> 15:38.577
fetch the tokens and keys for you.

15:38.597 --> 15:41.937
You'll be in charge of our house.

15:41.957 --> 15:43.677
Sorry to trouble you with that.

15:44.957 --> 15:48.387
No trouble at all, Mother.

15:48.837 --> 15:50.197
Rest assured.

15:50.357 --> 15:52.837
I won't disappoint you.

15:53.267 --> 15:55.667
As long as we work together,

15:55.787 --> 15:57.747
there's nothing we can't get through.

16:01.997 --> 16:02.977
My Lady,

16:02.997 --> 16:04.617
your Soothing Soup.

16:04.637 --> 16:05.997
Allow me.

16:09.907 --> 16:12.117
Take it while it's hot.

16:25.477 --> 16:27.517
Yu Qi of Capital Security again.

16:27.517 --> 16:28.877
Your Highness...

16:29.357 --> 16:30.217
I'm sorry!

16:30.237 --> 16:31.597
Please spare me!

16:32.427 --> 16:33.787
Useless.

16:33.877 --> 16:36.027
- Flog her 20 times outside.
- Yes.

16:36.027 --> 16:37.517
I'm sorry! Spare me, please!

16:37.517 --> 16:38.887
How clumsy!

16:38.907 --> 16:40.667
The trial will begin soon.

16:40.667 --> 16:42.287
They won't be able to find him.

16:42.307 --> 16:44.507
Everything is going as your plan.

16:46.117 --> 16:47.667
Earl Dongping's Mansion

16:49.027 --> 16:50.957
shall be hoisted by their petard.

17:04.547 --> 17:05.907
Miss,

17:06.677 --> 17:08.567
we're about to go to court.

17:08.587 --> 17:10.147
Do you have a plan yet?

17:15.347 --> 17:16.697
Aman,

17:16.717 --> 17:18.217
I need to see Qiaoniang.

17:18.237 --> 17:19.597
Yes.

17:41.997 --> 17:43.357
Qiaoniang.

17:44.267 --> 17:45.627
I got it.

17:47.757 --> 17:49.237
Aman, guard the door.

17:49.237 --> 17:50.467
Yes.

17:50.487 --> 17:51.847
Si,

17:52.267 --> 17:53.757
you look haggard.

17:54.517 --> 17:56.427
Your stomach is huge.

17:56.587 --> 17:58.077
Is the baby due soon?

17:59.547 --> 18:01.517
Let's get you seated.

18:03.547 --> 18:04.907
Careful.

18:06.587 --> 18:07.947
Let's sit.

18:10.437 --> 18:11.797
Si,

18:11.827 --> 18:12.827
you still treat me

18:12.827 --> 18:14.427
as your sister.

18:15.067 --> 18:16.947
I'm ashamed of myself.

18:17.157 --> 18:19.187
Despite what happened to us,

18:19.787 --> 18:21.947
you came to see me so late.

18:23.237 --> 18:24.607
I know for sure

18:24.627 --> 18:26.517
you treat me as your sister, too.

18:26.587 --> 18:28.077
You deserve it.

18:30.157 --> 18:32.467
Ji Chongyi shall be condemned,

18:32.547 --> 18:33.847
having him burned

18:33.867 --> 18:34.937
or drowned to pay

18:34.957 --> 18:36.457
for your brother's suffering!

18:36.477 --> 18:37.837
Qiaoniang,

18:37.957 --> 18:39.287
did he

18:39.307 --> 18:41.117
say anything to you?

18:41.477 --> 18:42.867
A few days ago,

18:43.197 --> 18:45.797
he was forced into Grand Princess's Mansion.

18:46.167 --> 18:47.067
Earlier today, I heard

18:47.067 --> 18:49.277
she had her guards seal your mansion.

18:49.437 --> 18:50.797
Ji Chongyi

18:51.067 --> 18:52.937
told me about what happened that night

18:52.957 --> 18:54.667
to the last detail.

18:55.027 --> 18:57.187
No matter how much Zhan suffered,

18:59.787 --> 19:01.147
tell me about it.

19:02.587 --> 19:04.037
That night...

19:19.027 --> 19:20.707
Why didn't the fire

19:20.917 --> 19:23.277
kill all of them that night?

19:24.157 --> 19:25.267
Cui Mingyue is

19:25.267 --> 19:27.357
still alive and kicking

19:28.027 --> 19:31.037
while Zhan's body is nowhere to be found.

19:31.107 --> 19:32.457
Hadn't it been for me,

19:32.477 --> 19:34.607
you and Ji wouldn't have become enemies.

19:34.627 --> 19:36.837
Cui Mingyue was the one behind everything.

19:37.157 --> 19:39.467
Ji Chongyi wouldn't dare kill others.

19:39.517 --> 19:40.767
But I don't get it.

19:40.787 --> 19:41.627
Why did she

19:41.627 --> 19:43.327
go after my brother

19:43.347 --> 19:45.317
and the Fragrance Shop?

19:45.547 --> 19:47.737
When she was riding in the streets that day,

19:47.757 --> 19:48.827
she and the two of you

19:48.827 --> 19:50.187
had a fight.

19:50.517 --> 19:52.377
Mr. Yu brought her to his office

19:52.397 --> 19:54.037
and almost had her flogged.

19:54.107 --> 19:56.037
She had never felt so humiliated

19:56.717 --> 19:58.707
and held a grudge against you two.

19:59.757 --> 20:02.317
What's the difference

20:02.587 --> 20:04.387
between people and ants?

20:06.957 --> 20:08.947
Perhaps in Cui Mingyue's eyes,

20:10.267 --> 20:11.627
my brother's life is

20:13.397 --> 20:15.117
as cheap as an ant's.

20:16.397 --> 20:18.597
However much trouble she caused,

20:18.957 --> 20:20.347
her powerful mother

20:20.347 --> 20:22.047
would clean up the mess.

20:22.067 --> 20:22.957
The Grand Princess

20:22.957 --> 20:24.897
claimed that Cui Mingyue was having a fever

20:24.917 --> 20:26.007
and still unconscious

20:26.027 --> 20:27.107
while having Ji Chongyi

20:27.107 --> 20:28.377
treated in her mansion.

20:28.397 --> 20:29.347
She must've planned

20:29.347 --> 20:31.287
to lay the blame on Zhan for everything.

20:31.307 --> 20:33.247
If her plan worked, that'd be great.

20:33.267 --> 20:34.187
If not, it'd be

20:34.207 --> 20:35.267
Ji Chongyi who framed Zhan,

20:35.267 --> 20:36.757
not Cui Mingyue.

20:36.867 --> 20:38.067
Duke An's Mansion wouldn't dare

20:38.067 --> 20:39.827
act against Her Highness openly.

20:40.517 --> 20:42.707
I don't know how I can help you.

20:44.027 --> 20:45.387
Thanks anyway.

20:46.677 --> 20:48.117
Whatever it takes,

20:49.437 --> 20:51.357
I demand an answer.

20:52.867 --> 20:54.797
I think I know what to do.

20:58.237 --> 20:59.737
(Capital Security Office)
Your Honor,

20:59.757 --> 21:02.287
my brother, Jiang Zhan, is still missing.

21:02.307 --> 21:04.667
I'm here to sue

21:04.717 --> 21:06.417
Ji Chongyi, Zhang Sheng,

21:06.437 --> 21:09.047
Yang Shengcai, Cui Yi, Cui Mingyue,

21:09.067 --> 21:09.957
all five of them

21:09.957 --> 21:11.607
for harming my brother by conspiracy.

21:11.627 --> 21:13.837
Enough of your sheer nonsense!

21:13.917 --> 21:16.007
Jiang Zhan was too drunk to control himself.

21:16.027 --> 21:17.527
He set the house on fire

21:17.547 --> 21:19.937
which killed Cui, Zhang,

21:19.957 --> 21:20.937
and Yang.

21:20.957 --> 21:22.247
Although Princess Mingyue

21:22.267 --> 21:23.737
and I survived,

21:23.757 --> 21:25.557
we were badly burned,

21:25.627 --> 21:27.227
Your Honor.

21:27.957 --> 21:30.597
So Jiang Zhan committed arson, drunk.

21:30.717 --> 21:31.937
Do you have any proof?

21:31.957 --> 21:33.007
I'm the witness.

21:33.027 --> 21:34.237
Zhan and Princess Mingyue

21:34.237 --> 21:35.517
had never met.

21:35.537 --> 21:37.137
Why did he attend her banquet?

21:37.157 --> 21:38.527
She invited Mr. Zhang

21:38.547 --> 21:40.317
to that banquet.

21:40.437 --> 21:42.377
He was a good man.

21:42.397 --> 21:43.287
He knew

21:43.307 --> 21:45.247
the Jiangs and I were enemies.

21:45.267 --> 21:48.177
He invited Jiang Zhan over

21:48.197 --> 21:49.847
to play the peacemaker

21:49.867 --> 21:51.697
so that we'd bury the hatchet.

21:51.717 --> 21:53.197
Unexpectedly,

21:53.197 --> 21:54.767
after drinking a few cups,

21:54.787 --> 21:56.327
Jiang Zhan started ranting,

21:56.347 --> 21:59.077
calling Zhang Sheng a meddler

21:59.157 --> 22:00.677
and roughing

22:00.677 --> 22:01.897
the kind Mr. Zhang up

22:01.917 --> 22:04.567
before setting that house on fire.

22:04.587 --> 22:06.117
According to you,

22:06.237 --> 22:07.767
he burned that place alone.

22:07.787 --> 22:08.987
So the five of you just let him

22:08.997 --> 22:10.497
when he did it?

22:10.517 --> 22:12.177
Except Princess Mingyue,

22:12.197 --> 22:13.697
the rest of you are

22:13.717 --> 22:15.137
strong young men

22:15.157 --> 22:16.767
who had learned some martial arts.

22:16.787 --> 22:18.897
Even if Zhan had three heads and six arms,

22:18.917 --> 22:20.067
couldn't all of you combined

22:20.067 --> 22:21.807
- stop him?
- You...

22:21.827 --> 22:23.737
One on five? He couldn't have won.

22:23.757 --> 22:25.397
Jiang Zhan didn't burn that place.

22:25.397 --> 22:26.327
Princess Mingyue is

22:26.347 --> 22:27.717
the Grand Princess's only daughter.

22:27.717 --> 22:29.417
A humble earl's son

22:29.437 --> 22:30.677
wouldn't dare harm her

22:30.677 --> 22:31.737
no matter how bold he was.

22:31.757 --> 22:32.737
It's hard to say.

22:32.757 --> 22:34.797
A drunk man could be crazy.

22:34.827 --> 22:36.187
Order!

22:37.517 --> 22:38.657
What's your explanation?

22:38.677 --> 22:39.917
I didn't say he burned

22:39.917 --> 22:41.847
the place in front of us.

22:41.867 --> 22:43.737
After he was kicked out,

22:43.757 --> 22:46.137
he sneaked back and set it on fire

22:46.157 --> 22:48.457
when we were drunk and unconscious.

22:48.477 --> 22:50.737
If all of you were unconscious

22:50.757 --> 22:53.087
when Zhan did it,

22:53.107 --> 22:54.377
how did you know

22:54.397 --> 22:56.317
it was him?

22:56.397 --> 22:57.717
I went to the toilet.

22:57.717 --> 22:58.787
When I came back,

22:58.787 --> 23:00.377
I happened to see him

23:00.397 --> 23:01.497
burning the house.

23:01.517 --> 23:02.787
As soon as he saw me,

23:02.787 --> 23:04.527
he jumped into the water to escape

23:04.547 --> 23:06.287
while the fire was raging.

23:06.307 --> 23:08.007
It was too late to put it out.

23:08.237 --> 23:10.497
Your Honor, he holds a grudge
against our clan

23:10.517 --> 23:12.497
because I canceled our engagement.

23:12.517 --> 23:13.517
Just now,

23:13.517 --> 23:14.807
he contradicted himself.

23:14.827 --> 23:15.907
His statement doesn't stand.

23:15.907 --> 23:17.147
Your Honor,

23:17.307 --> 23:18.807
my burned leg

23:18.827 --> 23:20.527
is the most direct evidence.

23:20.547 --> 23:22.087
In the critical situation that night,

23:22.107 --> 23:24.357
all of us panicked.

23:24.717 --> 23:26.397
It's understandable

23:26.417 --> 23:28.047
that I don't remember everything.

23:28.067 --> 23:30.287
After days of salvage by your office,

23:30.307 --> 23:32.627
only Jiang Zhan hasn't been found.

23:32.787 --> 23:35.557
He must've fled to escape punishment.

23:36.677 --> 23:39.387
Please issue an all-points bulletin

23:39.997 --> 23:41.217
to uphold justice

23:41.237 --> 23:44.567
for the deceased and injured soon!

23:44.587 --> 23:46.087
Your words alone

23:46.107 --> 23:48.027
aren't enough to convict Jiang Zhan.

23:48.867 --> 23:50.387
At this stage,

23:50.437 --> 23:52.087
only if we find him

23:52.107 --> 23:53.977
will we know the truth.

23:53.997 --> 23:56.657
Your Honor, he told me

23:56.677 --> 23:58.807
about what happened that night.

23:58.827 --> 24:00.977
Do you know where Jiang Zhan is?

24:00.997 --> 24:02.137
Yes.

24:02.157 --> 24:03.517
Impossible!

24:03.547 --> 24:04.517
Hadn't he already...?

24:04.517 --> 24:06.797
What? Why was it impossible?

24:14.957 --> 24:16.317
I knew it.

24:16.347 --> 24:18.177
Your clan claimed that he went missing

24:18.197 --> 24:19.657
after falling into the river,

24:19.677 --> 24:21.417
but you hid him somewhere.

24:21.437 --> 24:24.137
Your Honor, you can't cover for them.

24:24.157 --> 24:25.007
Jiang Si,

24:25.027 --> 24:27.497
where exactly is Jiang Zhan?

24:27.517 --> 24:29.377
Last night, he came to my dream

24:29.397 --> 24:31.377
where he told me everything

24:31.397 --> 24:33.287
with no omission.

24:33.307 --> 24:35.087
My brother didn't set that place on fire.

24:35.107 --> 24:37.467
I won't allow him to be wronged.

24:39.267 --> 24:41.527
A bolt from the blue indicates injustice!

24:41.547 --> 24:43.237
Who knows Jiang Zhan died

24:43.237 --> 24:44.437
and came to his sister's dream?

24:44.447 --> 24:45.287
Could the dead

24:45.307 --> 24:47.047
go to others' dreams for help?

24:47.067 --> 24:48.347
Zhang Sheng tricked my brother

24:48.347 --> 24:49.897
into going to the Huiyue House.

24:49.917 --> 24:50.787
When he was there,

24:50.787 --> 24:52.847
the five of them

24:52.867 --> 24:54.667
tortured him to death!

24:59.627 --> 25:00.947
Animals!

25:00.967 --> 25:02.437
- Monsters!
- That princess was evil!

25:02.437 --> 25:03.797
Indeed.

25:06.717 --> 25:08.527
How absurd!

25:08.547 --> 25:09.897
The court can't

25:09.917 --> 25:12.567
take her ridiculous dream seriously.

25:12.587 --> 25:14.657
Your Honor, have someone check

25:14.677 --> 25:15.677
the evidence salvaged

25:15.677 --> 25:16.527
that day

25:16.547 --> 25:18.837
and see if there's a duck-shaped censer.

25:19.587 --> 25:20.657
Guards,

25:20.677 --> 25:22.037
go now.

25:38.477 --> 25:39.767
Ji Chongyi,

25:39.787 --> 25:41.147
answer my question.

25:41.237 --> 25:42.327
Did you

25:42.347 --> 25:44.087
see that censor at the scene?

25:44.107 --> 25:45.467
I...

25:46.067 --> 25:47.007
I don't remember.

25:47.027 --> 25:49.077
Let me help you jog your memory.

25:49.717 --> 25:51.527
When you were done beating my brother,

25:51.547 --> 25:53.497
you found that he stopped breathing.

25:53.517 --> 25:54.517
Then you and Cui Yi

25:54.517 --> 25:56.867
threw him into the Jinshui River.

25:57.197 --> 25:58.557
Ji Chongyi,

25:58.757 --> 26:00.417
you killed my brother!

26:00.437 --> 26:01.787
You shall die!

26:01.787 --> 26:03.197
No, no!

26:03.197 --> 26:04.107
I didn't kill him.

26:04.107 --> 26:05.527
I only kicked him twice.

26:05.547 --> 26:06.587
Princess Mingyue had them

26:06.587 --> 26:08.237
drown Jiang Zhan. It wasn't me!

26:08.237 --> 26:09.197
I didn't kill him!

26:09.197 --> 26:10.767
I didn't do it!

26:10.787 --> 26:12.947
Ji Chongyi, how dare you

26:12.997 --> 26:14.457
frame Princess Mingyue!

26:14.477 --> 26:16.007
Did he frame her,

26:16.027 --> 26:18.267
or did the Grand Princess's family

26:18.267 --> 26:20.087
abuse their power to kill the innocent?

26:20.107 --> 26:22.567
Can the superior royalty

26:22.587 --> 26:24.667
take others' lives as you please?

26:24.787 --> 26:25.897
You committed crimes

26:25.917 --> 26:27.477
but brazenly made an innocent man

26:27.477 --> 26:29.437
- your scapegoat.
- Right.

26:29.437 --> 26:31.047
How vicious and shameless!

26:31.067 --> 26:32.267
Others' lives matter, too!

26:32.267 --> 26:33.297
He works for the Princess.

26:33.297 --> 26:34.347
Yes, he is.

26:34.367 --> 26:35.257
- Order!
- Scram!

26:35.257 --> 26:36.307
You must be evil, too.

26:36.307 --> 26:37.377
Order!

26:37.397 --> 26:39.417
This is a court,

26:39.437 --> 26:40.767
not a farmer's market.

26:40.787 --> 26:43.247
Although that dream is unusual,

26:43.267 --> 26:45.087
the evidence

26:45.267 --> 26:46.847
and the details Jiang Si said

26:46.867 --> 26:49.327
match the facts of this case.

26:49.347 --> 26:50.707
Jiang Si,

26:50.747 --> 26:52.757
did your brother mention that fire

26:52.757 --> 26:53.717
in your dream?

26:53.717 --> 26:55.077
I...

26:57.517 --> 26:59.437
Remember, you're with me all night.

26:59.437 --> 27:01.037
You didn't go anywhere.

27:04.107 --> 27:06.007
The wind knocked over the candlestick,

27:06.027 --> 27:07.387
causing the fire.

27:07.867 --> 27:09.497
Fire! Fire!

27:09.517 --> 27:10.717
Run! Stop drinking!

27:10.717 --> 27:11.847
Fire!

27:11.867 --> 27:13.137
Run!

27:13.157 --> 27:14.807
- Fire!
- Fire!

27:14.827 --> 27:16.427
Fire!

27:20.107 --> 27:20.997
It started burning,

27:20.997 --> 27:23.047
but no one at the banquet moved. Why?

27:23.067 --> 27:24.807
Because they were stoned,

27:24.827 --> 27:26.627
thinking the fire wasn't real.

27:27.107 --> 27:28.567
Then Cui Mingyue

27:28.587 --> 27:30.667
jumped out the window first.

27:31.347 --> 27:32.397
Zhang Sheng and Cui Yi

27:32.397 --> 27:34.457
got their legs pinned down by the beams.

27:35.477 --> 27:37.327
Yang Sheng couldn't swim

27:37.347 --> 27:38.757
and drowned.

27:44.397 --> 27:46.457
When Zhang asked Ji Chongyi for help,

27:46.477 --> 27:47.627
Ji Chongyi ignored him

27:47.627 --> 27:48.737
and escaped alone,

27:48.757 --> 27:49.627
leaving Zhang and Cui

27:49.627 --> 27:51.387
being burned to death.

27:55.997 --> 27:58.147
Guards, call the coroner.

28:00.307 --> 28:01.177
Your Honor,

28:01.197 --> 28:02.237
there are traces of liquor

28:02.237 --> 28:03.697
being burned in Zhang's abdomen.

28:03.717 --> 28:05.347
Yang and Cui's families

28:05.347 --> 28:06.627
said no autopsies.

28:06.627 --> 28:08.287
The causes of their deaths are unknown.

28:08.307 --> 28:09.757
Zhang's and Cui's deaths

28:09.757 --> 28:11.977
are the result of smoke inhalation

28:11.997 --> 28:14.527
while Yang Shengcai drowned.

28:14.547 --> 28:15.977
They all match.

28:15.997 --> 28:17.327
Unbelievable!

28:17.347 --> 28:19.217
Jiang Zhan's soul

28:19.237 --> 28:20.597
- must've seen it
- He's innocent!

28:20.597 --> 28:22.557
and told Miss Si in her dream.

28:23.307 --> 28:24.497
Ji Chongyi,

28:24.517 --> 28:25.807
at this point,

28:25.827 --> 28:27.277
stop telling lies.

28:27.307 --> 28:29.807
Did all of you torture Jiang Zhan to death?

28:29.827 --> 28:31.567
If you believe a ghost,

28:31.587 --> 28:33.337
this shouldn't be the Capital Security Office

28:33.347 --> 28:35.007
but the Judge of Death's Office.

28:35.027 --> 28:36.977
Instead of having you judge the case,

28:36.997 --> 28:38.507
wouldn't it be easier to hire a shaman

28:38.507 --> 28:39.567
to talk to the dead?

28:39.587 --> 28:40.497
Yes.

28:40.517 --> 28:41.697
Yes. That's right.

28:41.717 --> 28:43.137
There isn't such a thing as ghost.

28:43.157 --> 28:44.067
Your office

28:44.067 --> 28:45.457
must've been bought over.

28:45.477 --> 28:47.607
You and Jiang Si

28:47.627 --> 28:49.627
made up such a story.

28:50.717 --> 28:52.997
If you don't believe in ghosts,

28:53.107 --> 28:54.767
why did you confess just now

28:54.787 --> 28:57.277
that they tortured Jiang Zhan to death

28:57.627 --> 28:59.027
before Jiang Mingyue had them

28:59.027 --> 29:00.827
throw him into the Jinshui River,

29:00.827 --> 29:02.707
but you only kicked him twice?

29:04.027 --> 29:07.217
Jiang Si messed with my head,

29:07.237 --> 29:09.547
making me ramble!

29:09.547 --> 29:10.697
Ramble?

29:10.717 --> 29:12.737
Ji Chongyi, you're in court.

29:12.757 --> 29:13.787
Every word you say

29:13.787 --> 29:15.427
is documented.

29:15.587 --> 29:17.137
Don't try to deny it.

29:17.157 --> 29:18.997
If you convict me

29:18.997 --> 29:20.767
simply based on a ridiculous dream

29:20.787 --> 29:21.917
instead of solid evidence,

29:21.917 --> 29:23.067
it's unfair.

29:23.067 --> 29:24.467
Unfair?

29:25.587 --> 29:28.517
You want solid evidence, huh?

29:42.397 --> 29:43.737
There he is.

29:43.757 --> 29:45.437
Why is he soaking wet?

29:45.437 --> 29:46.517
There was no rain.

29:46.517 --> 29:47.877
Right.

30:07.477 --> 30:08.957
Ghost! Ghost!

30:08.957 --> 30:10.427
A ghost!

30:10.787 --> 30:13.317
Ghost! Ghost!

30:16.867 --> 30:18.377
Ji Chongyi,

30:18.397 --> 30:20.287
tell the truth,

30:20.307 --> 30:23.037
or I'll drag you to hell with me.

30:24.157 --> 30:26.267
Go away! I didn't kill you!

30:26.267 --> 30:27.717
It had nothing to do with me.

30:27.717 --> 30:29.827
It was... it was Princess Mingyue!

30:29.827 --> 30:31.397
She told me to do that.

30:31.397 --> 30:32.677
Grand Princess didn't want her

30:32.677 --> 30:34.757
to appear in court

30:35.157 --> 30:37.157
and forced me to lie.

30:37.157 --> 30:38.107
Princess Mingyue

30:38.107 --> 30:39.157
didn't faint.

30:39.157 --> 30:41.007
Take revenge on her. Leave me alone!

30:41.027 --> 30:42.517
Don't come to me. I swear...

30:42.517 --> 30:44.287
I didn't do anything!

30:44.307 --> 30:45.147
Spare me, please!

30:45.157 --> 30:45.997
Don't kill me!

30:45.997 --> 30:47.157
I'm begging you!

30:47.157 --> 30:48.557
Spare me!

30:54.627 --> 30:55.987
Zhan...

31:05.267 --> 31:06.627
You're back!

31:07.717 --> 31:09.197
Is Young Master Zhan

31:09.197 --> 31:11.997
a human or a ghost?

31:12.347 --> 31:14.737
That court upholds justice for humans.

31:14.757 --> 31:16.267
Can it do the same

31:16.267 --> 31:18.247
for ghosts?

31:18.267 --> 31:20.227
Don't leave us hanging.

31:20.267 --> 31:21.847
Don't spoil our appetite!

31:21.867 --> 31:23.087
- Yes.
- Right.

31:23.107 --> 31:24.007
How about this?

31:24.027 --> 31:25.757
I'll pay for the next chapter.

31:25.757 --> 31:26.847
Finish the story.

31:26.867 --> 31:29.657
Yes, tell us now.

31:29.677 --> 31:31.937
- Say it.
- What happened next

31:31.957 --> 31:36.147
will be told in the ensuing chapter.

31:51.157 --> 31:52.517
Father.

32:00.347 --> 32:01.707
Father!

32:04.397 --> 32:05.997
Father!

32:12.397 --> 32:13.757
Zhan...

32:15.787 --> 32:17.147
Zhan!

32:17.957 --> 32:19.427
Zhan!

32:20.267 --> 32:21.477
Zhan!

32:21.477 --> 32:24.137
- Father!
- Is it you, Zhan?

32:24.157 --> 32:25.837
I'm back.

32:26.757 --> 32:28.227
That's great.

32:29.197 --> 32:31.737
I'm so glad you're back!

32:31.757 --> 32:33.117
Father!

32:46.547 --> 32:48.267
Slow down. Don't choke on it.

32:48.267 --> 32:50.147
- It's so good.
- Have some water.

32:52.997 --> 32:54.247
By the way,

32:54.267 --> 32:55.527
have all your injuries

32:55.547 --> 32:56.897
healed?

32:56.917 --> 32:58.277
Right.

32:58.717 --> 33:00.477
Shall we call a physician

33:00.477 --> 33:01.957
to check him again just in case?

33:01.957 --> 33:02.897
Sure.

33:02.917 --> 33:05.317
No need. I've fully recovered.

33:06.107 --> 33:07.467
Look.

33:11.677 --> 33:12.957
Rest for a few more days

33:12.957 --> 33:14.937
and I'll be as strong as an ox again.

33:16.237 --> 33:17.087
Besides,

33:17.107 --> 33:18.697
those losers

33:18.717 --> 33:20.177
couldn't have broken me.

33:20.197 --> 33:22.427
I'd be fine even if there were more of them.

33:22.547 --> 33:24.087
Listen to yourself

33:24.107 --> 33:25.907
talking big.

33:27.347 --> 33:29.567
Alright, tell us

33:29.587 --> 33:31.307
how you managed to survive

33:31.307 --> 33:33.277
and had a narrow escape.

33:36.997 --> 33:38.047
I played dead.

33:38.067 --> 33:39.517
Played dead?

33:39.867 --> 33:41.657
They wanted me dead, right?

33:41.677 --> 33:43.037
So I faked it.

33:43.157 --> 33:43.997
They couldn't have

33:43.997 --> 33:45.597
brought me back from death.

33:51.397 --> 33:53.567
Your Grace, he's dead.

33:53.587 --> 33:54.947
What to do?

33:55.237 --> 33:57.117
Toss him into the river

33:57.277 --> 33:58.917
to leave no trace behind.

33:59.277 --> 34:00.607
Unexpectedly,

34:00.627 --> 34:01.857
those animals

34:01.877 --> 34:03.787
meant to get rid of my body.

34:03.997 --> 34:05.607
I had never known

34:05.627 --> 34:07.747
the Jinshui River was that deep.

34:08.067 --> 34:08.997
When I almost drowned,

34:08.997 --> 34:10.527
I heard you calling me

34:10.547 --> 34:12.347
and moved my body like crazy.

34:12.587 --> 34:14.307
But I became exhausted

34:14.437 --> 34:16.047
before reaching the surface.

34:16.067 --> 34:17.437
I thought

34:17.957 --> 34:20.077
I could never see you two again.

34:20.707 --> 34:22.827
That was the last thing I knew.

34:24.477 --> 34:25.527
Then

34:25.547 --> 34:26.857
who saved your life?

34:26.877 --> 34:27.957
It was me, of course,

34:27.957 --> 34:29.317
who saved him.

34:35.357 --> 34:36.897
Actually, Qi figured out your location

34:36.917 --> 34:38.597
and had me check downstream.

34:40.317 --> 34:41.457
Brilliant!

34:41.477 --> 34:43.457
You bet. Don't you know who I am?

34:43.477 --> 34:44.607
I gave him food and water.

34:44.627 --> 34:45.647
I even caught fish.

34:45.667 --> 34:46.877
Why didn't you come back

34:46.877 --> 34:48.457
as soon as you were saved?

34:48.477 --> 34:49.587
I almost died of grief

34:49.587 --> 34:51.337
because of you!

34:51.357 --> 34:52.297
Father,

34:52.317 --> 34:53.477
I wished to grow wings

34:53.477 --> 34:55.117
to come back at once,

34:55.477 --> 34:57.557
but I was injured back then.

34:58.147 --> 34:59.507
Plus,

35:00.277 --> 35:02.187
the mountain path was muddy.

35:48.997 --> 35:50.627
What are you doing?

35:53.837 --> 35:54.937
Treat your injury.

35:54.957 --> 35:56.317
What is that?

35:57.587 --> 35:58.977
Will it hurt?

35:58.997 --> 36:00.357
A little bit.

36:01.397 --> 36:02.257
Bear with it.

36:02.277 --> 36:03.707
Easy...

36:07.067 --> 36:08.857
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

36:08.877 --> 36:10.477
If you can feel it,

36:13.147 --> 36:14.827
you'll recover soon.

36:18.517 --> 36:20.307
How come a girl like you

36:20.917 --> 36:23.117
presses so hard?

36:26.707 --> 36:28.067
Press it yourself.

36:37.397 --> 36:39.267
You shouldn't touch me.

36:47.027 --> 36:48.557
Hold it.

36:49.477 --> 36:51.257
Don't drop it.

36:51.277 --> 36:52.637
Understand?

37:00.437 --> 37:01.917
Fine.

37:10.067 --> 37:11.337
We'll

37:11.357 --> 37:13.077
rest here tonight.

37:14.517 --> 37:15.877
Here?

37:17.317 --> 37:19.077
I've barely survived.

37:19.147 --> 37:20.877
If I stay the night here,

37:21.227 --> 37:23.007
I'll end up dead.

37:23.027 --> 37:24.337
Spit it. Don't curse yourself.

37:24.357 --> 37:26.347
I don't want to die with you.

37:26.477 --> 37:27.837
Wait here.

37:32.287 --> 37:33.297
I'll go catch a fish.

37:33.317 --> 37:35.207
I'll go with you.

37:35.227 --> 37:36.587
You?

37:36.667 --> 37:38.027
Stay here.

37:38.147 --> 37:39.687
If you get injured again,

37:39.707 --> 37:41.257
things will be even worse.

37:41.277 --> 37:42.637
I'm fine.

37:44.667 --> 37:45.817
Besides,

37:45.837 --> 37:47.457
I have no more medicine.

37:47.477 --> 37:48.957
Alright then.

38:14.107 --> 38:15.837
♪ From place to place ♪

38:15.837 --> 38:20.777
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

38:21.147 --> 38:23.527
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

38:23.527 --> 38:27.757
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

38:28.467 --> 38:30.867
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

38:30.887 --> 38:34.547
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

38:34.567 --> 38:37.987
♪ Growing between us ♪

38:40.277 --> 38:41.787
Eat it.

38:44.517 --> 38:46.787
Wait. I'll feed you.

38:48.157 --> 38:52.237
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

38:52.477 --> 38:54.217
♪ Like shadows ♪

38:54.237 --> 38:58.937
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

38:58.937 --> 39:01.877
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

39:01.877 --> 39:02.727
Eat.

39:02.727 --> 39:06.757
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

39:06.777 --> 39:08.567
♪ Time glows ♪

39:08.587 --> 39:09.997
Is it good?

39:12.677 --> 39:13.537
Yes.

39:13.537 --> 39:17.077
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

39:17.097 --> 39:21.257
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

39:21.417 --> 39:23.177
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

39:23.177 --> 39:27.697
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

39:27.697 --> 39:31.357
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

39:31.377 --> 39:37.057
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

39:38.737 --> 39:40.657
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

39:40.657 --> 39:48.177
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪

39:56.877 --> 39:58.417
We've packed up everything.

39:58.437 --> 40:00.347
Come on. Let's go.

40:00.837 --> 40:02.557
- Sure.
- I got you.

40:02.957 --> 40:04.317
Slowly.

40:04.477 --> 40:05.837
Slowly.

40:08.837 --> 40:09.977
What's wrong?

40:09.997 --> 40:11.397
Does it hurt again?

40:12.227 --> 40:13.727
- Where? Let me see.
- Here.

40:13.747 --> 40:14.647
Here.

40:14.667 --> 40:16.267
- It's poking me.
- Where?

40:21.837 --> 40:23.197
What's this?

40:23.317 --> 40:25.047
I carved it

40:25.067 --> 40:28.477
to kill time last night. Here you go.

40:31.747 --> 40:34.067
Jiang Zhan, I didn't know

40:34.067 --> 40:36.227
you had deft hands.

40:40.627 --> 40:42.147
What's so funny?

40:43.027 --> 40:44.387
What is it?

40:44.707 --> 40:46.067
Nothing.

40:47.027 --> 40:49.147
Is that a cow or a horse?

40:53.627 --> 40:55.047
The pig

40:55.067 --> 40:57.347
looks cute.

40:58.707 --> 41:00.067
Give me.

41:02.587 --> 41:04.567
It's a horse!

41:04.587 --> 41:07.147
A miniature of your horse!

41:08.957 --> 41:11.147
When the Fragrance Shop opened,

41:11.277 --> 41:13.277
you gave that horse you carved

41:13.277 --> 41:15.037
to my sister.

41:16.187 --> 41:18.117
A horse, huh?

41:19.917 --> 41:21.317
Fine. It'll be

41:21.317 --> 41:23.077
my new amulet.

41:27.067 --> 41:28.427
Well...

41:28.627 --> 41:30.347
thank you

41:31.107 --> 41:32.467
for saving my life.

41:39.357 --> 41:40.717
Don't mention it.

41:41.707 --> 41:43.007
Had it been

41:43.027 --> 41:44.517
a dog

41:44.797 --> 41:46.187
in the water that day,

41:46.277 --> 41:47.767
I would've done the same.

41:48.747 --> 41:50.497
When my condition became better,

41:50.517 --> 41:52.517
I had Chuchu bring me back.

41:52.667 --> 41:53.997
As soon as we entered the city,

41:53.997 --> 41:55.317
I heard everyone in town

41:55.317 --> 41:57.307
talking about the open trial in court.

41:57.357 --> 41:58.687
We asked around about it.

41:58.707 --> 41:59.897
Chuchu was so smart.

41:59.917 --> 42:00.857
She told me

42:00.877 --> 42:01.977
to play a ghost

42:01.997 --> 42:03.437
and go there.

42:03.877 --> 42:04.857
What about

42:04.877 --> 42:07.517
the blood covering your face?

42:15.067 --> 42:16.427
Clever, huh?

42:18.477 --> 42:19.437
I wonder

42:19.437 --> 42:21.347
what Chuchu is doing now.

42:23.147 --> 42:25.877
I haven't thanked her properly.

42:35.437 --> 42:37.007
Lady Jiang invited us to dinner.

42:37.027 --> 42:38.577
And you're telling me now?

42:38.877 --> 42:40.917
Lu Chuchu, get changed. Hurry!

42:49.737 --> 42:54.057
(The End of Episode 14)

